  "title": "Handi Chicken",
  "slug": "handi-chicken",
  "description": "A rich North Indian chicken curry cooked with deeply caramelized onions, tomatoes, yogurt, and aromatic spices. This restaurant-style handi chicken develops a naturally thick gravy without using nuts, making it flavorful, comforting, and perfect with naan or jeera rice.",
